of this puzzle together.

502
00:29:34.650 --> 00:29:36.442
- Can we... Can we...
- All right. Okay.

503
00:29:36.443 --> 00:29:38.612
- Got you.
- Thank you. Come on.

504
00:29:45.035 --> 00:29:46.328
I'll tell you what I know.

505
00:29:47.788 --> 00:29:50.414
- We're listening.
- I had the kids running suicides...

506
00:29:50.415 --> 00:29:52.875
- All right!
- <i>...and I saw Trey was limping.</i>

507
00:29:52.876 --> 00:29:55.003
There ain't no time to be hurt. Let's go.

508
00:29:56.421 --> 00:29:58.840
So I told him to sit out,
and ice his ankle.

509
00:29:58.841 --> 00:30:01.092
- Stretch that out, stretch that out.
- Yeah.

510
00:30:01.093 --> 00:30:04.721
