523
00:30:29.413 --> 00:30:32.374
- Yeah, sure thing, Officer Bolton.
- Bolton.

524
00:30:33.166 --> 00:30:35.042
Officer McGillicuddy, you want one?

525
00:30:35.043 --> 00:30:37.128
- Nah, I'm good.
- Celtics fan.

526
00:30:37.129 --> 00:30:39.089
Ah, yeah, that figures.

527
00:30:40.883 --> 00:30:42.717
