599
00:34:07.631 --> 00:34:09.048
I told you.

600
00:34:09.049 --> 00:34:10.466
- I told you.
- [David] Yeah, you did.

601
00:34:10.467 --> 00:34:12.552
- [laughs]
- You did. You did, brother.

602
00:34:12.553 --> 00:34:13.928
You sure did.

603
00:34:13.929 --> 00:34:15.471
[dramatic music playing]

604
00:34:15.472 --> 00:34:17.349
