Trey! My baby! [sobs]

610
00:34:51.049 --> 00:34:53.426
My baby. My son.

611
00:34:53.427 --> 00:34:56.721
Oh, my God! Thank you, God. Thank you.

612
00:34:56.722 --> 00:34:59.098
- [Paul] Trey, where's Kyle?
