675
00:37:41.637 --> 00:37:42.970
But you...

676
00:37:42.971 --> 00:37:46.307
Baby, you don't need to concern yourself
with any of that. You just rest up, okay?

677
00:37:46.308 --> 00:37:50.144
- I mean, if... if we're his only chance.
- [phone ringing]

678
00:37:50.145 --> 00:37:52.731
[Bridges] Mr. and Mrs. King, come on down!
