Okay, get some chairs, get some chairs.

682
00:38:04.201 --> 00:38:06.327
Okay, listen to me, listen very carefully.

683
00:38:06.328 --> 00:38:08.079
Keep him talking, so speak slowly,

684
00:38:08.080 --> 00:38:10.581
